    "summary": "A **hazard roll** for a unit is 1 D6, failing on a 1-2; the unit then takes 1 **[mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**, or 3 if every model in it is a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** model. Roll all of a unit's hazard rolls at once.",
